2026-10-25T10:11:20.4139300Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4880650Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4927680Z [0m
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4939940Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4944980Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4957890Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4969180Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4969810Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4970100Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4970350Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4970760Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4971140Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4971590Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4972190Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4973610Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4973930Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4974130Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4974350Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4974660Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4974900Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4975280Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4975470Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4975620Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4975740Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4976080Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4976630Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4978480Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4979850Z I will:
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4981590Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4982340Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4983340Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4984030Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4984430Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4984830Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4985230Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4985820Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T10:11:20.4986680Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5036690Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5037140Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5100440Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5101140Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5107320Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5108360Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5108890Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5109650Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5110610Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
