2026-10-25T10:11:20.5179690Z [34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5214810Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5216240Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5217240Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5217790Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5218270Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5219030Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5219390Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5220400Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5221020Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:20.5221330Z If you would like to
